{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research", "label": "Research 015 \u2014 Decis\u00f5es D1..D9", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research_gate_clean", "label": "Gate mvn -B clean test (clean obrigat\u00f3rio)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O maven-resources-plugin copia recursos para target/classes mas n\u00e3o remove c\u00f3pias obsoletas; sem clean os nomes antigos permanecem e as su\u00edtes falham por contagem/nome \u2014 \u00e9 c\u00f3pia obsoleta, n\u00e3o defeito da renomea\u00e7\u00e3o (Princ\u00edpio VI)."}, {"id": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research_rename_item", "label": "Mec\u00e2nica de renomea\u00e7\u00e3o com Rename-Item (sem git mv, sem copiar+apagar)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O AGENTS.md global pro\u00edbe comandos git sem invoca\u00e7\u00e3o expl\u00edcita; Rename-Item preserva conte\u00fado, \u00e9 at\u00f4mico o suficiente para arquivos locais e falha em colis\u00e3o. git mv, copiar+apagar e script Groovy de build foram rejeitados."}, {"id": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research_hash_integridade", "label": "Integridade de conte\u00fado por SHA-256 antes/depois", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A spec exige conte\u00fado id\u00eantico (FR-010, SC-007); o hash prova que a renomea\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o tocou bytes, independentemente do tamanho ou formata\u00e7\u00e3o, e \u00e9 prova direta independente de git diff ou inspe\u00e7\u00e3o visual."}, {"id": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research_phase_detection", "label": "Detec\u00e7\u00e3o de dois estados independentes (schemaRenamed / othersRenamed)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "As duas user stories podem ser aplicadas em ordens diferentes; um \u00fanico n\u00famero de fase n\u00e3o representa as quatro combina\u00e7\u00f5es. Um \u00fanico templatePhase=3 quebraria a independ\u00eancia das hist\u00f3rias."}, {"id": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research_suite_strategy", "label": "Estrat\u00e9gia de su\u00edtes: estender as phase-aware, atualizar as listas fixas, n\u00e3o criar su\u00edte nova", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ContractTemplateRenameContractTest e FileRenameContractTest j\u00e1 concentram provas de nomes, contagens, \u00edndice, README e anti-drift; estend\u00ea-las mant\u00e9m a evolu\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rica test\u00e1vel. Uma su\u00edte nova duplicaria verifica\u00e7\u00f5es e ampliaria o escopo cir\u00fargico."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_research", "target": "specs_015_remove_contract_template_prepositions_spec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/015-remove-contract-template-prepositions/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source